                                            <div class="solutions-tab_tab-content-left">
                                                <h3 class="heading-style-h5 text-weight-semibold">Heart health &amp; hypertension</h3>
                                                <div class="spacer-small"></div>
                                                <p class="text-size-regular opacity-80">
                                                    Example use cases:<br/>
                                                    <br/>
                                                    1. Enable users to track blood pressure trends non-invasively, supporting early detection and better management of hypertension.<br/>
                                                    2. Detect irregular heart rhythms and provide real-time alerts for potential cardiac events.<br/>3. Remind users to take prescribed heart medications and track their impact on cardiovascular health.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="solutions-tab_tab-graphic-wrapper">
                                                <img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680280c18df8e68403545b30/680280c18df8e68403545dd4_Hearh%20health%20%26%20BP.svg" alt="" class="solutions-tab_tab-graphic"/>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div data-w-tab="Tab 2" class="solutions-tab_tab-pane w-tab-pane">
                                        <div class="solutions-tab_tab-content">
                                            <div class="solutions-tab_tab-content-left">
                                                <h3 class="heading-style-h5 text-weight-semibold">Longevity &amp; wellness</h3>
                                                <div class="spacer-small"></div>
                                                <p class="text-size-regular opacity-80">
                                                    Example use cases: <br/>
                                                    ‍<br/>
                                                    1. Show users how daily habits (sleep, activity, diet) affect long-term wellness and aging.<br/>2. Provide actionable tips to extend healthspan based on individual data trends.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="solutions-tab_tab-graphic-wrapper">
                                                <img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680280c18df8e68403545b30/680280c18df8e68403545dd5_Longevity.svg" alt="" class="solutions-tab_tab-graphic"/>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div data-w-tab="Tab 3" class="solutions-tab_tab-pane w-tab-pane">
                                        <div class="solutions-tab_tab-content">
                                            <div class="solutions-tab_tab-content-left">
                                                <h3 class="heading-style-h5 text-weight-semibold">Mental health &amp; stress management</h3>
                                                <div class="spacer-small"></div>
                                                <p class="text-size-regular opacity-80">
                                                    Example use cases:<br/>
                                                    ‍<br/>
                                                    <strong>1. </strong>
                                                    Measure heart rate variability (HRV) and stress level to objectively assess stress and recovery.<br/>
                                                    2. Offer guided breathing and relaxation exercises with real-time physiological feedback.<br/>3. Help users understand how mental states influence their body and vice versa.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="solutions-tab_tab-graphic-wrapper">
                                                <img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680280c18df8e68403545b30/680280c18df8e68403545dd6_Mental%20%26%20stress.svg" alt="" class="solutions-tab_tab-graphic"/>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div data-w-tab="Tab 4" class="solutions-tab_tab-pane w-tab-pane">
                                        <div class="solutions-tab_tab-content">
                                            <div class="solutions-tab_tab-content-left">
                                                <h3 class="heading-style-h5 text-weight-semibold">Chronic illness management</h3>
                                                <div class="spacer-small"></div>
                                                <p class="text-size-regular opacity-80">
                                                    Example use cases: <br/>
                                                    ‍<br/>
                                                    1. Support ongoing management of diabetes, COPD, and other chronic illnesses with continuous vital sign tracking.<br/>
                                                    2.Identify concerning trends early, enabling timely interventions and reducing hospitalizations.<br/>3. Share data securely with healthcare providers for proactive care adjustments.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="solutions-tab_tab-graphic-wrapper">
                                                <img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680280c18df8e68403545b30/680280c18df8e68403545dd7_Chronic%20illness.svg" alt="" class="solutions-tab_tab-graphic"/>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div data-w-tab="Tab 5" class="solutions-tab_tab-pane w-tab-pane">
                                        <div class="solutions-tab_tab-content">
                                            <div class="solutions-tab_tab-content-left">
                                                <h3 class="heading-style-h5 text-weight-semibold">Weight management</h3>
                                                <div class="spacer-small"></div>
                                                <p class="text-size-regular opacity-80">
                                                    Example use cases:<br/>
                                                    ‍<br/>
                                                    1. Track resting heart rate and other indicators to assess metabolic changes during weight loss.<br/>
                                                    2. Monitor how exercise and recovery impact cardiovascular health during weight management programs.<br/>3. Tailor recommendations based on physiological responses to diet and exercise.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="solutions-tab_tab-graphic-wrapper">
                                                <img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680280c18df8e68403545b30/680280c18df8e68403545dd8_Weight.svg" alt="" class="solutions-tab_tab-graphic"/>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div data-w-tab="Tab 6" class="solutions-tab_tab-pane w-tab-pane">
                                        <div class="solutions-tab_tab-content">
                                            <div class="solutions-tab_tab-content-left">
                                                <h3 class="heading-style-h5 text-weight-semibold">Sports &amp; fitness performance</h3>
                                                <div class="spacer-small"></div>
                                                <p class="text-size-regular opacity-80">
                                                    Example use cases:<br/>
                                                    ‍<br/>
                                                    1. Provide real-time heart rate and recovery data to maximize training efficiency.<br/>
                                                    2. Use HRV and resting heart rate trends to prevent burnout and injuries.<br/>
                                                    3. Visualize improvements in cardiovascular fitness over time.<br/>
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="solutions-tab_tab-graphic-wrapper">
                                                <img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680280c18df8e68403545b30/680280c18df8e68403545dd9_Sports.svg" alt="" class="solutions-tab_tab-graphic"/>
