                                        <div class="solutions-tab_tab-content">
                                            <div class="solutions-tab_tab-content-left">
                                                <h3 class="heading-style-h5 text-weight-semibold">Beauty &amp; cosmetics</h3>
                                                <div class="spacer-small"></div>
                                                <p class="text-size-regular opacity-80">
                                                    Example use cases:<br/>
                                                    <br/>
                                                    1. Recommend cosmetics based on vascular age, wellness score or other health metrics <br/>
                                                    2. Boost user &#x27;s engagement by daily health checks <br/>
                                                    3. Objectively measure physiological changes after cosmetic treatments.<br/>4. Suggest skincare routines based on individual health and stress markers.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="solutions-tab_tab-graphic-wrapper">
                                                <img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/680280c18df8e68403545b30/680280c18df8e68403545dda_Beauty.svg" alt="" class="solutions-tab_tab-graphic"/>
